OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786906081
OL,3,CTeenager stabbed in Brighton city
OL,4,Ccentre
OL,6,FA 17-year-old boy was stabbed in
OL,7,FBrighton city centre on Saturday
OL,8,Fevening.
OL,10,FHe was taken to hospital with
OL,11,Finjuries, which were not serious or
OL,12,Flife threatening.
OL,14,FIt happened at around 5.10pm on
OL,15,FSaturday (15 August) between Kingsway
OL,16,Fand Western Road in the city.
OL,18,FPolice are appealing for witnesses or
OL,19,Fanyone who has dashcam or CCTV footage
OL,20,Fof what happened.
