OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786906081
OL,3,CTeenager stabbed in Brighton city
OL,4,Ccentre
OL,6,FDetective Inspector Jenny Pietersen
OL,7,Fsaid: "We are appealing for anyone who
OL,8,Fsaw the incident to come forward. The
OL,9,Farea was very busy at that time and we
OL,10,Fwould like to hear from anyone who has
OL,11,Fmobile phone, dashcam or CCTV footage
OL,12,Fwhich could help our investigation.
OL,14,F"We understand reports of this nature
OL,15,Fare concerning for the public and we
OL,16,Fhave our neighbourhood policing teams
OL,17,Fout in the city carrying out enquiries.
OL,19,F"Please speak to our officers if you
OL,20,Fhave concerns or any information in
OL,21,Frelation to this incident."
